"sourcePersonId":"vndb:s39034","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s39034","name":"Sennzai","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:199739","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"燈華 いのり","creatorId":"vndb:s39035","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s39035","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s39035","name":"燈華 いのり","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:199740","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"塚本 のべる","creatorId":"vndb:s39036","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s39036","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s39036","name":"塚本 のべる","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:199741","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"天乃 アト","creatorId":"vndb:s39464","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s39464","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s39464","name":"天乃 アト","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:199746","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"五郎","creatorId":"vndb:s39583","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s39583","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s39583","name":"五郎","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:199747","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Spirit Garden","creatorId":"vndb:s42102","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s42102","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s42102","name":"Spirit Garden","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:199748","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c133473","characterName":"トウリ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"148805","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"456680"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26060"],"vndbCharacterId":"c133473"},"originalCharacterName":"トウリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Sister Maid: Charming All Hearts, Devoted to One"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the orphans who grew up with her \"Onii-chan\" Nagi at the Sugara District orphanage. While Nagi took one route into Ougen Academy, Touri found her own way to slip through the cracks - all to keep an eye on him and watch his back."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Touri's gentle nature makes her a natural charmer, winning hearts wherever she goes. But beneath that soft exterior lie nerves of steel forged in Sugara District's tough streets. Nothing fazes her; she takes everything in stride."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Around Nagi, though, Touri shows her true colors. This typically easy-going girl becomes a force of nature where he's concerned - revealing a bold streak that leaves others stunned."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"When you're starving and finally get to eat... that first bite just hits different. Can't beat that feeling.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c133473"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"凪と同じく珠賀良区の孤児院で育った子供達の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お兄ちゃん」と呼び慕う凪をサポートするため、凪とは別の方法で桜元学園へ潜入する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりとした雰囲気で誰とでもすぐに打ち解けられる人当たりの良さと、珠賀良区で生きてきた経験から、何事にも動じない度胸を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"凪に対する気持ちが非常に強く、普段からは想像もつかない積極性を、凪に対してのみ発揮することがある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26060","sourceWorkId":"35179","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"凪と同じく珠賀良区の孤児院で育った子供達の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お兄ちゃん」と呼び慕う凪をサポートするため、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"凪とは別の方法で桜元学園へ潜入する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりとした雰囲気で誰とでもすぐに打ち解けられる"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人当たりの良さと、珠賀良区で生きてきた経験から、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何事にも動じない度胸を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"凪に対する気持ちが非常に強く、普段からは想像もつかない"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"積極性を、凪に対してのみ発揮することがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お腹を空かしながら、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ようやく食べられた一口は本当に幸せで、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ああ美味しいなって"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強く感じられるの」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148805"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2dea9c8d3c803e33860f89c6672ce6dc985e10ba4cced230e9ee9487853e5c4a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ff3dd24732bab2a54c426f18826d7a668bbe89275a6be0de7b1985a15e34a9e6.webp","width":165,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"七種結花","creatorId":"vndb:s22881","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s22881","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s22881","name":"佐藤 詩乃","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:456680:148805:56606:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c133474","characterName":"夜刀 くくる","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"148804","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"456680"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26059"],"vndbCharacterId":"c133474"},"originalCharacterName":"夜刀 くくる","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"830"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An Outstanding Engineer Boasting Overwhelming Wealth"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kukuru may just be a first-year student, but she calls the shots as the General Head of all the cultural clubs in the school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A trailblazing genius, she's among the nation's foremost researchers in automata theory and stands at the cutting edge of artificial intelligence development. A rationalist to the core, Kukuru ruthlessly cuts away anything that doesn't serve her research. Socializing and savoring a good meal aren't even on her radar—it's all work and no play."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her research demands colossal funding, but leveraging the investment acumen inherited from her parents, she single-handedly amassed a vast fortune. Many clubs have dipped into Kukuru's personal coffers for loans, leaving them indebted and unable to bite the hand that feeds them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"...Unbelievably stupid. I'm just done.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c133474"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一年生ながら学内全ての文化部を取り仕切る文化部総括。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オートマタ研究において国内でも有数の研究者で、特に人工知能の開発分野では最先端を行く天才エンジニア。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし研究の役に立たないものは切り捨てる合理主義者でもあり、特に人付き合いや食事に対して一切の興味がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"研究には莫大な資金を要するが、両親から受け継いだ投資家の才能を用いて、一代で莫大な財を成した。くくる個人の資産から融資してもらった部活も多く、みな彼女には頭が上がらない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26059","sourceWorkId":"35179","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一年生ながら学内全ての文化部を取り仕切る文化部総括。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オートマタ研究において国内でも有数の研究者で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に人工知能の開発分野では最先端を行く天才エンジニア。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし研究の役に立たないものは切り捨てる合理主義者でも"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あり、特に人付き合いや食事に対して一切の興味がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"研究には莫大な資金を要するが、両親から受け継いだ投資家の"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"才能を用いて、一代で莫大な財を成した。くくる個人の資産から"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"融資してもらった部活も多く、みな彼女には頭が上がらない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……バカ過ぎて驚いた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"驚きを通り越して呆れた」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148804"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/248a9af4edc26a31e07258dc2f0a233bdbf498db79427736b2028f93c7834774.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c5095e0d961c0df4ed32abeb0f9fa36410b7d9e822ad70c05e2630dbe10234cf.webp","width":134,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"湯宮由海","creatorId":"vndb:s5006","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5006","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5006","name":"湯宮 由海","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:456680:148804:19558:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c133475","characterName":"一色 奏命","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"148802","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"456680"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26057"],"vndbCharacterId":"c133475"},"originalCharacterName":"一色 奏命","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"505"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Aristocratic Leader: Japan's Shadow Ruler, Elite Academy's Queen"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Meet the Student Council President of Ougen Academy - Kaname, heir to a noble Isshiki lineage whose aristocratic roots stretch back to the Meiji era. She's every bit the blue blood, ruling the roost in her final year."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When her parents' passing made her head of the family, she stepped up like she'd been doing it all her life. No surprise there - she's been groomed for greatness since day one."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Steel and ice in public, she keeps everyone at arm's length with her perfect poker face. But around the Houjou sisters, who grew up serving at her side? That's when you might catch a glimpse of her sweeter side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Worry not. Be you from Sugara District or elsewhere - we have but one purpose.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c133475"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明治時代から続く、誇り高き永世華族【一色家】の長女にして、桜元学園では学生会会長を務める三年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親の死をきっかけに若くして当主の座についたが、幼少期より受けた英才教育の結果、既に支配者の風格を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"厳然とした言動で他者を寄せ付けず、人前では表情を一切崩さないが、付き人として共に育った北条姉妹には心を許しており、時折優しい顔も見せる。"}